  "description": "Compare and move Dynamics 365 Contact Center configuration between environments: workstreams with their routing configurations, work classification and route-to-queue rules, queues, rulesets, templates, capacity profiles and channels. Records are matched by name, never by GUID. Every dependency is checked before anything runs; then dry run, apply with a check afterwards that the target matches the source, and rollback from a snapshot.",
